    "code": "total = self._succ_agg + self._crash_agg + self._to_agg; if total >= self._progress_log_interval:",
    "mechanism": "The stop condition is a >= test evaluated ONCE PER VECTORISED STEP, after every env that finished in that step has been aggregated. With 128 parallel envs, a counter at 2047 becomes 2049 when two envs terminate in the same step. Exact equality with 2048 is reachable only when the final step happens to contribute exactly the remaining count. Theoretical maximum overshoot is num_envs-1 = 127; observed maximum is 2."
  },
  "causes_ruled_out": {
